Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.41,0:01:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.35,0:01:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I just dreamt Bakura went\Ntotally mental. Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.05,0:01:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time I snoozed with\Ndueling cards under my pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.97,0:01:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleep well, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.55,0:01:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I dreamt Yugi had us all dressed up like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.93,0:01:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,duel monster cards and\Nthat you'd gone nuts,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.03,0:01:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,so no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.11,0:01:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.03,0:01:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounded like mine. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.15,0:01:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, birdie-haws.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.61,0:01:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My harpies!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.57,0:01:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you mean eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.39,0:01:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.13,0:01:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hand over all your\Nstar chips, you loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.83,0:01:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.93,0:02:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.15,0:02:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This sideshow freak\Ngiving you a hard time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Pegasus pays me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.21,0:02:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Root out all the dueling filth\Non this island and dispose of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that make you a garbage man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.05,0:02:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.31,0:02:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic's one of the island's eliminators,\Nand if you don't get out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.47,0:02:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,he's going to do to you what he did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.95,0:02:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eliminator?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.86,0:02:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.33,0:02:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, this is what she means right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.59,0:02:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out her duelist\Nglove, not a starship left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But that would mean\Nshe's been disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.13,0:02:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're out, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.77,0:02:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It all happened so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The way Panic duels, I just lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She was one of my easiest victims yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.03,0:02:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You creep. Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no excuse for pushing a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.39,0:02:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel, but that\Nguy's more than twice your size.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.43,0:02:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I could take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:02:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:02:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fists aren't the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.87,0:03:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Violence won't solve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I've dealt with a lot\Nof bullies in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.53,0:03:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm afraid there's only\None way to deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.81,0:03:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.95,0:03:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stand up to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.69,0:03:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi now, let's see you try your\Nintimidation tactics against me. Panic I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,don't scare easy especially when i'm\Nstanding up for my friends so let's do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.95,0:03:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,you twerk i'll eliminate\Nyou from the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.93,0:03:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,just like i did her tell\Nhim how i trust you Please
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.91,0:03:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi let her go panic if\Nyou're looking to bully
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.99,0:04:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone try bullying me.\NPlaytime is now over, panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.69,0:04:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi no problem show panic here how we deal\Nwith dogs like him Yugi must be my lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.25,0:04:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,day Pegasus has promised a generous bounty
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Eliminator who\Ndefeats you, I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,think you'd throw in some extra\Ncash for inflicting bodily harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.75,0:04:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I wouldn't do it for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You better start thinking\Nof other ways to make money,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.55,0:04:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic, because after I get done with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,not only will you be out some star\Nchips, but you'll be out of a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.77,0:04:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever said I was an eliminator\Njust for the money, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made enough cash to\Nhave retired long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.85,0:04:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but I won't quit because there's no better
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,thrill than breaking\Nweak duelists like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.69,0:04:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So get ready, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to take you into a world\Nof hurt. I won't be bullied by the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,likes of you panic I play with my heart\Nthat's why I'll always win against
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:05:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,your type you've never faced my\Ntype before when I'm in a match with
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,someone there's a lot more to it\Nthan sheer dueling strategy meaning
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.11,0:05:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,panic's ruthless Yugi he had\Nme totally terrified that's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.53,0:05:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,right and she's not the first\Neither we eliminators have
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.85,0:05:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,built our career on stalking\Nweak players like her and strong
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,arming them into dueling us\Nyou see when you're as good as
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.77,0:05:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,i am you learn to appreciate\Nthe hunt as much as the duel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,itself and now i'm gonna take\Nyou down just like i did my i
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.25,0:05:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,see how you work panic sneaking\Nup on unsuspecting duelists
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,because you haven't the courage\Nto challenge them face to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.18,0:05:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your mouth, you insolent cur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,True duelists fight\Nwith honor and respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,not the underhanded tactics of a poacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.99,0:05:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And to prove it, I wager all the star\Nchips I have to win back Mize. It's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you win, I'll give you\Nall eight of her star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.43,0:05:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The bet makes no difference to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:05:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.43,0:06:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What I mean, little Yuki, is\Nthat when you duel against panic,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.33,0:06:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,you're putting much more than just\Nyour measly star chips on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.71,0:06:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.57,0:06:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get him out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't take the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.39,0:06:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, get used to it, because you're\Nstrapped in for the long haul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn it off, Panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic used those on me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.73,0:06:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.85,0:06:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see the fear growing\Nin your eyes, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.15,0:06:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear you quaking in your boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're beginning to realize the\Nnightmare you've stepped into.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.55,0:06:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I do believe you're beginning to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a life, you psycho!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.13,0:06:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget this guy, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This wasn't part of the job description.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.37,0:07:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get you\Ndown from there, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.11,0:07:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you finished blowing\Nsmoke, Panic? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he think he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It will take much more than cheap\Npyrotechnics to make me lose my cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.05,0:07:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time someone had the\Nnerve to talk to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.39,0:07:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I broke them in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.11,0:07:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's do them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.49,0:07:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's good, but he's never\Nfaced an Eliminator before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Panic gets inside\Nhis head, it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing how the blaze of my fire didn't\Nfaze you, let's turn down the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My castle of dark illusions will turn\Nthis duel into your darkest hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Its magic shrouds\Nthe field with a veil of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.55,0:07:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,shadows And the castle\Nitself is extra fortified
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the field power\Nbonus I get for praying
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,in at night I'm not\Nafraid of the dark panic
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.87,0:08:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You would be if you only knew The\Nfearsome nightmares within its
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.19,0:08:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,shade The Blanket of Shadows cast\Nover my entire side of the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,making it impossible for you\Nto see the creatures I summon,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but leaves your entire side exposed\Nand vulnerable to my attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.37,0:08:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Unnerving, isn't it, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.29,0:08:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How the darkness preys on\Nyour fears, on your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.51,0:08:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,until you're too scared to\Nthink, too terrified to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.45,0:08:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.87,0:08:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly how he threw me\Noff my game! Now you tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.87,0:08:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you think you\Ncan storm my castle with
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the help of a field power\Nbonus of your own, think again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Because just as my shadows\Nblock the light from above,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,they block the field power\Nfrom the ground below.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the Knight grants bonus is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.87,0:08:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Without any idea what's waiting for me\Nin those shadows, I can't risk an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to play it safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:08:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Celtic Guardian, defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a very bright idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.57,0:09:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see what monster he played.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.11,0:09:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark, grasp of fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Our first victim of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.09,0:09:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi. That's cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.83,0:09:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you defend against\Nwhat you can't see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, or defeat a monster you can't find.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.85,0:09:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody got a flashlight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.87,0:09:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Even your friends have lost hope for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get his monsters\Nout of those shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But the only way I can do that is by\Ndestroying his Castle of Dark Illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And with its defensive\Npoints set at 2,500,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,no card in my deck has an attack\Npower high enough to scratch it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.81,0:09:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,let alone destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.89,0:09:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.83,0:09:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to understand why\Nthey call him Panic The game
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:10:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,just started and I'm already\Nflustered Play any monster card you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.85,0:10:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,like The creatures within my\Nveil of shadows will consume them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,all Winged Dragon and Guardian\Nof the Fortress in defense mode
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This defensive maneuvering may keep\Nyour life points safe from one monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi But not two
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.31,0:10:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it, but he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.51,0:10:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Defending alone won't\Nwin this duel for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.13,0:10:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're terrified, aren't\Nyou, Yugi? Admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.35,0:10:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All your courage has been\Ndevoured by my shadowy fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.91,0:10:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, all that's left is a trembling little\Nduelist powerless to defend himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.51,0:10:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So how's Yugi supposed to\Ntake this guy out, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.15,0:10:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If I was able to figure that out,\Nwe wouldn't be in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.17,0:10:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be some way to\Nneutralize Panic's Veil of Shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.79,0:10:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's generated by his\NCastle of Dark Illusions,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:10:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and that thing's virtually impregnable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.67,0:11:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.79,0:11:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not be able to\Nattack Panic's castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.71,0:11:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but what if I attack the darkness itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Guardian of the Fortress, take flight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireball attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.23,0:11:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So you saw my creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but I doubt it gives you the\Nforesight to see what's coming next!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Grasp of Fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lights out for your\NGuardian of the Fortress!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.37,0:11:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My creatures hungrily eye your\Nremaining life points, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.33,0:11:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and i'll see to it that\Nthey feed again quite soon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,has it sunk in yet wimp\Nstanding up to a bully leaves
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.85,0:11:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you nowhere to go but\Ndown down is right my life
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,points are way down while\Npanics haven't even been
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.85,0:12:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,touched his shadows have\Ndestroyed two of my best
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.57,0:12:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters while i still can't\Nsee what i'm up against
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,he's got me outmaneuvered\Nand overpowered and i'm still
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna find a way to put\Nthat big bully in his place
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The knight has eyes, Yugi,\Nand all of them are on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you as long as panic's\Ncastle of dark illusions
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.41,0:12:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,shrouds his side of the\Nfield with that shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,it's impossible for me to\Nsee any of his monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.07,0:12:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,panicking about it will only\Nmake things worse so i gotta
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.41,0:12:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,do my best not to let him\Nsee me sweat Keep struggling,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.67,0:12:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, bullying's so much\Nmore fun when you resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.39,0:12:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic Coming from someone\Nwho makes all their
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,attacks While hiding in\Nthe safety of shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.45,0:12:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.17,0:12:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.67,0:12:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You uppity,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:13:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,little cream Perhaps you\Nshould think twice before you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,insult someone Who can scorch\Nyou with the touch of a button,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.31,0:13:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're afraid, Yugi. You're\Nlost and alone in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm the big bad boogeyman about to leap\Nout and give you the scare of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could see what I have in store\Nfor you, you wouldn't be laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.37,0:13:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's why I'm laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.49,0:13:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I can see right through you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.43,0:13:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking\Nabout, you little runt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.09,0:13:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the boogeyman panic scaring\Nchildren into being afraid of the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.47,0:13:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,until they realize the Dark is\Nnothing to be afraid of, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Once a person conjures up the confidence\Nnot to be fearful of the unknown,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.87,0:13:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,they've disarmed the\Nonly weapon the Dark has.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You wish it was that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.07,0:13:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.27,0:13:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the card to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.97,0:13:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What card?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.23,0:13:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A card that'll expose you and lift up\Nthat veil of shadows you cower behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:13:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.03,0:14:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a little something that'll teach\Nyou a tough lesson in broad daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mai, why would Yugi\Ntell Panic his strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.95,0:14:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The same thing happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.85,0:14:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You start making amateur mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.49,0:14:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.11,0:14:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look like he's panicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You almost had me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.67,0:14:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But we both know that card's\Nnothing but a big, fat bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Prove me wrong, Yugi. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.55,0:14:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see you give me my tough lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.29,0:14:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I show you my card after you've
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.71,0:14:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,gone to such lengths to\Nkeep yours in the dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't trust me, Panic?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.11,0:14:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, not all\Nduelists are lying dogs like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.95,0:14:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And to prove it, I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.01,0:14:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I wouldn't want you\Nthinking I was some kind of liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.73,0:14:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.07,0:14:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to prove\Nanything to that slime, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.79,0:14:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, Panic? Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.03,0:14:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Swords of Revealing Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Revealing Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The blinding magic of the Swords\Nof Revealing Light not only
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.67,0:15:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,stops all enemy monsters from\Nattacking for three full turns,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but it bathes the entire\Nfield in a light so luminous
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.59,0:15:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that even your lurking shadow\Ncreatures will be exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.81,0:15:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, Panic, the monsters in your\Ndark empire will have nowhere to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.15,0:15:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But rather than play it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.65,0:15:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take a page from your book and let\Nyou worry about when and how I'll use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,just like you do with the\Nmonsters you hide in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.97,0:15:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down in five turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.61,0:15:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Five turns, Panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.75,0:15:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then my monsters will finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse of Dragon, Defensive Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And, of course, the card that\Nwill make you see the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your five turns start now, Panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.89,0:15:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taunting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the Swords\Nof Revealing Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.63,0:15:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Panic?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.23,0:16:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Has bullying lost its thrill?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.29,0:16:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you about Blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.59,0:16:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mai, why is Yugi keeping that card\Nout if he's not going to play it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I hate to say it, guys,\Nbut it's not a good sign. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.27,0:16:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to keep it together\Nfor about this long, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But after a while, Panic has a way of\Ngetting to you and making you slip up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.09,0:16:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.57,0:16:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.69,0:16:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I know Yugi's good, but\Nfighting Panic isn't about being good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about keeping a\Nlevel head while you're
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,lost in the dark or\Nbeing attacked by fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's gonna need guts to win\Nthis duel, not skill. Guts, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's got heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.29,0:16:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.89,0:16:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but he did just leave his\Nbest card out fully vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.51,0:16:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't make those kinds of\Nmistakes unless you're nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.83,0:16:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And Panic's not one to let a\Nmistake like that go unpunished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:16:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move, Panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.15,0:17:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,it was quite a daring move to illuminate\Nme with the presence of that card,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.67,0:17:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.13,0:17:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was a critical mistake to leave\Nit on the field completely exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.03,0:17:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you thought idle cards were safe\Nfrom attacks, you were dead wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Reaper of the Cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.39,0:17:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,when the reaper has summoned\Nall magic cards hear the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,ghostly toll of doom he'll be\Nsending your revealing light
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.69,0:17:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,card to the discard graveyard\Nleaving you defenseless
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.59,0:17:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Reaper, attack Yugi, but that\Ncard was Yugi's only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.09,0:17:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fate belongs to me now,\NYugi. Call of the Graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.23,0:18:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.37,0:18:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't finish its attack
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It should have destroyed\Nyour card. The swords
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.63,0:18:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Of revealing light, I said\Nmy swords of revealing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.71,0:18:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,light is the card that\Nwould illuminate your
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.65,0:18:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters I never said\Nit was the one I placed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.31,0:18:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,on the field you just assumed that but if
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,that's not the card I\Nplaced on the field was a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,different card the spell\Nbinding circle a trap
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,card yes a trap card\Nthat snares your reaper,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,stopping him dead in his tracks,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.47,0:18:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,encircling him in a magical prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.05,0:18:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In Duel Monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.45,0:18:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,one must be wary of the\Nreaper of the cards and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.81,0:18:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,its ability to send magic\Ncards to the discard pile.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:19:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured that you probably had one\Nstalking around in your deck somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.11,0:19:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that he's frozen,\Nunable to damage my deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.29,0:19:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free to lay whatever magic cards\NI want on the field. Great thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.95,0:19:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to put one over on him, Yuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.55,0:19:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it with this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.35,0:19:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even keep up with\Nhim here on the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.25,0:19:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's doing good, but it's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.45,0:19:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.91,0:19:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You fooled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.05,0:19:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You fooled yourself, Panic, and\Nwasted quite a powerful card, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.65,0:19:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that the coast is clear, I'll\Nreally lay my Swords of Revealing Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And a second magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Both face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.55,0:19:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Face down? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.85,0:19:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.65,0:19:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I bet we're\Ngoing to find out soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:19:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You captured my Reaper, but he's\Nonly one of my powerful monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.15,0:20:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones that remain will destroy you!
